Enhancement: Reduce memory usage for single Azure uploads

Uploads to Azure of up to 256 MiB previously copied the entire payload into an additional memory buffer.
Restic now uploads compatible seekable inputs directly, avoiding this extra allocation for ordinary byte and file readers.
Readers that cannot be uploaded directly retain the buffered path.
Transactional checksum validation and upload retries remain enabled.

